OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy at first with outbreaks
OL,6,Fof mainly light rain or drizzle.
OL,7,FSlowly turning drier and brighter
OL,8,Fthrough the morning, then becoming
OL,9,Fwidely sunny by the afternoon. Feeling
OL,10,Fchilly though, especially near the
OL,11,Fcoast where winds are strongest.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FDry early evening but cold
OL,14,Fwith frost developing in places. Rain
OL,15,Fspreading northeastwards overnight,
OL,16,Freaching all parts by morning and
OL,17,Fturning heavy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
