OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FCloudy and wet during the
OL,6,Fmorning with occasionally heavy bouts
OL,7,Fof rain. Drier and brighter periods by
OL,8,Fthe afternoon, but it will be breezy
OL,9,Fand feel fairly chilly.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,12,FChangeable on Wednesday and Thursday
OL,13,Fwith isolated heavy showers and bright
OL,14,For sunny intervals. Showers clearing
OL,15,Fon Friday. Temperatures near normal
OL,16,Ffor the time of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
